Package: perturbationkernel
Type: Package
Title: R Binding for perturbation-kernel
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Abhishek", "Shivakumar", email = "abhishek.shivakumar@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R and RStudio binding for the perturbation-kernel C ABI. The
    package is a thin wrapper around the Rust engine and preserves its
    deterministic execution and bit-identity guarantees.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: perturbation-kernel shared library
